{"id":"665061","name":"咸鸭蛋拌茄子","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/665061/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"咸鸭蛋","amount":"2只"},{"name":"茄子","amount":"5根"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"味精","amount":"适量"},{"name":"芝麻油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：、咸鸭蛋、茄子。","img":"images/665061/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将熟咸鸭蛋挖出蛋黄和蛋白捣碎。","img":"images/665061/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"将茄子去蒂清洗清洗，折成段。","img":"images/665061/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入电饭锅里。","img":"images/665061/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"盖上盖、插上电源、按好蒸煮键功能进行工作。","img":"images/665061/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"蒸煮7分钟。","img":"images/665061/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"开盖取出。","img":"images/665061/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"晾凉。","img":"images/665061/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"接着，加适量的盐。","img":"images/665061/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加适量的味精。","img":"images/665061/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加适量的芝麻油。","img":"images/665061/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"然后，合入咸鸭蛋拌匀即可。","img":"images/665061/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}